| BIRD (fAAaT826Vv) | Bayesian inference framework for LLM probabilities | 8, 8, 8 | Accept Oral |
| StructRAG (GhexuBLxbO) | Structured knowledge reconstruction for LLM reasoning | 8, 5, 8, 6 | Accept Poster |
